# Implementation Plan: Step 1 - Candidate S3 Transcript Batch Ingestion & Vector Indexing

This implementation plan details the technical architecture and step-by-step blueprint for **Step 1: Candidate S3 Transcript Batch Ingestion & Vector Indexing**. 

By completing this step, raw interview transcript text files stored in AWS S3 for any candidate (e.g., *Sejal Sawant*, *Khushi Pawar*, *1797*) will be automatically downloaded, parsed into Q&A turns, evaluated against your curriculum, embedded into vectors, and stored in ChromaDB.

**No code in your codebase will be changed today.**

